    "doc_text": "XIN_ENG_20061129.0133\n\nSEOUL, Nov. 29 , 2006 (Xinhua)\n\nSeoul stock market ends higher\n\n\n\n\nThe benchmark Korea Composite Stock Price Index (KOSPI) added 11.08 points to 1,422.55 on Wednesday.\n\nThe volume of KOSPI was moderate at 247 million shares worth 3. 46 trillion won (3.7 billion U.S. dollars).\n\nThe tech-rich KOSDAQ index gained 4.26 points to 617.19 with a volume of 671.025 million shares worth 2.275 trillion won (2.445 billion U.S. dollars).\n\nThe local currency ended at 930.50 won to one U.S. dollar, up 0. 30 won from Tuesday's close.",
